# Conventions pointer

**Read and apply** the rule files in **`src/Company.Shared/.cursor/`**:

1. **`dotnet-csharp-conventions.mdc`** — .NET C# style, formatting, mappers, patterns
2. **`microservices.mdc`** — microservice layout, REST/gRPC, `Result`, `ErrorCode` (when editing under `src/`)

Edit those files when conventions change — do not duplicate rules at the workspace root.
